+curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yooztech/agent-speed/main/install.sh | sh -s -- --uninstall
 ```
 
 ```powershell
-& ([scriptblock]::Create((irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zoefix/agent-speed/main/install.ps1))) -Uninstall
+& ([scriptblock]::Create((irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yooztech/agent-speed/main/install.ps1))) -Uninstall
 ```
 
-Add `--purge` / `-Purge` to remove settings as well. On Windows you can also uninstall from *Settings → Apps*.
+Add `--purge` / `-Purge` to remove settings as well. On Windows you can also uninstall from *Settings → Apps*; the Windows setup uninstaller preserves settings and SSH keys.
 </details>
 
